      <function kind="introText">
        <intro>Red lives a difficult life at the edge of the woods. She and her mother eke out a meager living selling hand-crafted pinatas on e-bay. Their craftsmanship is of unusual quality but under-appreciated by the majority of e-bay's clientele.</intro>
